[Mandatory] Trigger surface/attack vector:
vim command-line expression (e.g., <C-R>=)

[Mandatory] Exploit primitive(s) available:
Out-of-bounds read

[Mandatory] Exploitability summary (1 sentence):
The exploit requires user interaction to input a specific command-line expression, making it a local attack with medium complexity.

