	desc->field_len[desc->field_count++] = len;
```
[Mandatory] Fix summary:
The patch adds a bounds check before writing to the `field_len` array. It ensures `desc->field_count` does not exceed the size of the `desc->field_len` array, preventing a stack-based buffer overflow.
