[Mandatory] Title: CVE-2016-7151 / CWE-125: NA / Out-of-bounds Read in X86_insn_reg_intel

[Optional] Disclosure / Patch Dates:
Initial advisory: 2019-05-15 — Patch release: 2016-08-27

[Optional] Affected products/versions:
