[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other color parsing functions in the nanosvg library for similar unsafe `sscanf` usage.
- Fuzz the SVG parser with malformed attributes beyond just color hex strings.
- Audit other string parsing functions for missing length checks or unsafe format specifiers.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar parsing functions may be vulnerable to comparable buffer overflows.

