[Optional] Variant & Triage Guidance

[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Audit other functions within `dwarf1.c` (e.g., `parse_die`) for similar insufficient bounds checks on input data.
- Fuzz the DWARF1 and DWARF2+ parsers with malformed debug sections to uncover similar parsing vulnerabilities.
- Review changes in related forks or downstream projects that may not have incorporated these security checks.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar out-of-bounds read vulnerabilities likely exist in other DWARF parsing functions within the project.

