[Optional] Variant & Triage Guidance

[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):

- Review other file-parsing functions within the Redis codebase for similar lack of input validation.
- Fuzz the configuration file parser (`nodes.conf` and `redis.conf`) to discover potential similar parsing issues.
- Audit all uses of `atoi` or similar functions where the result is used as an array index or memory offset.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar parsing issues could exist in other configuration handlers or file parsers within the application.

