What did the fix do?
- Field: PatchType (bounds check added)
[Optional] Variant & Triage Guidance

[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other protocol parsers in tcpdump for similar missing `ND_TCHECK` calls before accessing packet data.
- Fuzz the Juniper parser and other dissectors with truncated captures to uncover latent over-reads.
- Diff against older versions or forks to ensure similar patterns are not present elsewhere.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Other dissectors in the project may have analogous missing bounds checks.

