[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other protocol parsers in tcpdump for similar missing `ndo` arguments in `l_strnstart` calls.
- Fuzz BEEP and related protocol parsers with truncated packets to uncover similar over-reads.
- Diff forks of tcpdump to ensure the fix is applied consistently.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar over-read vulnerabilities may exist in other protocol parsers missing bounds checks.

