[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other architectures' PLT processing functions for similar issues.
- Fuzz ELF binaries with crafted PLT sections to uncover related bugs.
- Audit other relocation processing paths for duplicate handling flaws.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar duplicate processing issues may exist in other ELF parsers.

