What did the fix do?
- Field: PatchType (logic refactor, feature removal)
[Optional] Variant & Triage Guidance

[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other GFS2 functions that interact with the page cache for similar allocation issues.
- Fuzz the fallocate implementation with various `len` and `offset` values, especially near boundary conditions.
- Audit other filesystems that may have adopted similar page cache-based fallocate logic for equivalent vulnerabilities.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Other filesystems using similar fallocate mechanisms may be susceptible to related memory corruption bugs.

