[Mandatory] Summary:
The vulnerability exists in the `filter_frame` function within `libavfilter/vf_showinfo.c`. The function iterates over frame planes to calculate checksums but fails to validate that the `frame->linesize[plane]` is non-zero before using it in calculations and pointer arithmetic. This can lead to an out-of-bounds memory access when processing a specially crafted frame, potentially resulting in information disclosure or a crash.
