		QETH_CARD_TEXT(card, 2, "snmpnome");
		return PTR_ERR(ureq);
	}

[Mandatory] Fix summary:
 The patch adds a bounds check on the user-provided `req_len` to ensure it does not exceed the available buffer space before proceeding with memory allocation and copy operations.

