[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other IOCTL handlers in the qeth driver for similar missing length validations.
- Fuzz the qeth driver's IOCTL interface to discover any other potential buffer overflows.
- Diff forks of the Linux kernel for similar code patterns that might lack this fix.

