 The patch changes the declaration of the `sample` buffer from a fixed size of 8 to `sample[FZ_MAX_COLORS]`, ensuring it is large enough to hold the maximum number of color components that can be written by `xps_parse_color`, thus preventing the stack buffer overflow.

