- Fuzz the tiff12nc device with files that produce non-standard raster dimensions to ensure no other overflows exist.
- Audit the codebase for uses of `gdev_prn_raster` where the returned size is used in loop iterations without alignment checks.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar out-of-bounds writes could exist in other device handlers with fixed-stride processing loops.

