[Mandatory] Root cause:
A use-after-free caused by incorrect ordering of operations where a failure point (tcf_change_indev) occurs after a reference count modification (tcf_bind_filter).
[Mandatory] Attack Surface:
Network traffic control (netfilter) subsystem
