- Include TCA_FW_CLASSID attribute to trigger tcf_bind_filter().
- Include a malicious TCA_FW_INDEV attribute designed to cause tcf_change_indev() to fail.
- The failure path returns an error after the reference count was modified.
- This sequence leaves the filter object in a state where it can be freed and used again.

Fix
[Mandatory] Fix code:
