- Create a crafted H.264 bitstream.
- The stream triggers the parsing of an intra-slice.
- The decoder's `u2_total_mbs_coded` counter is incremented incorrectly.
- This leads to a mismatch with the actual number of macroblocks processed.
- Subsequent operations that rely on this counter will use an incorrect value.
- This can lead to out-of-bounds memory writes or reads.

