[Mandatory] Fix summary:
 The patch corrects the logic by moving the `ps_dec->u2_total_mbs_coded` increment out of the per-macroblock loop. The counter is now correctly updated after a group of macroblocks is processed, ensuring the count matches the number of macroblocks handled by the decoder.

