Not available in input

[Optional] Variant & Triage Guidance

[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other PHAR archive parsing functions for similar lack of bounds checking.
- Fuzz the PHAR archive processing handlers with malformed archives to identify potential variants.
- Diff forks of the PHP source to check if the vulnerability was introduced elsewhere.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar out-of-bounds reads may exist in other parts of the PHAR parsing code, potentially leading to information disclosure or code execution.

