Commit 54d83fc74aa9ec72794373cb47432c5f7fb1a309 in torvalds/linux
[Optional] Patch Analysis:
What did the fix do?
- Field: PatchType (bounds check added, logic refactor, feature removal)
- Note: Logic refactor; the fix corrects the logic for determining if a rule is unconditional by passing the correct data structure to the helper function.
