[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other callers of the `unconditional()` helper for similar misuses.
- Audit the `mark_source_chains` function and its callers for other logic discrepancies in rule validation.
- Fuzz the netfilter rule parsing logic, especially with rules that mix unconditional and conditional attributes.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar argument-passing errors in other netfilter validation helpers could lead to comparable memory corruption vulnerabilities.

