Out-of-bounds write

[Mandatory] Exploitability summary (1 sentence):
The exploit is controlled by the size of the input file provided to the ragg2 compiler, allowing an attacker to trigger the overflow reliably.

[Mandatory] Exploit script (summary, 3—6 bullets):
- Create a specially crafted input file to be processed by ragg2.
- The file must contain enough elements to cause `egg->lang.elem_n` to exceed `sizeof(egg->lang.elem)`.
