 Commit b282620b7a8818910c42a29b8f0855a2d13eec14
[Optional] Patch Analysis:
What did the fix do?
- Field: PatchType (bounds check added)
[Optional] Variant & Triage Guidance

[Optional] Variant analysis suggestions (2—3 bullets):
- Review other parser functions in the `libr/parse/p/` directory for similar unsafe string handling patterns.
- Fuzz the radare2 parser with various file types and architectures to uncover potential buffer overflows.
- Audit the RParse API to ensure all functions using output buffers perform adequate size checks.

[Optional] Likely variants/impact (one line):
Similar buffer overflows may exist in other pseudo-instruction parsers.

